<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post115946386467481723..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: I Can&#39;t Stand Bullies</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>15</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-907093068703248398</id><published>2013-10-24T12:27:35.281-06:00</published><updated>2013-10-24T12:27:35.281-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Oh, I&amp;#39;m sorry. I thought that you had pity for...</title><content type='html'>Oh, I&amp;#39;m sorry. I thought that you had pity for bullies. But I was wrong. My apologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To make up for my false assumption, I congratulate you for taking the initiative to make this blog against bullies, whom I can&amp;#39;t stand either.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/907093068703248398'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/907093068703248398'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1382639255281#c907093068703248398' title=''/><author><name>Anon</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1266967414"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 24, 2013 at 12:27 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-782280492282647377</id><published>2013-07-15T22:13:51.257-06:00</published><updated>2013-07-15T22:13:51.257-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wait a minute! How can you hate bullies if you pit...</title><content type='html'>Wait a minute! How can you hate bullies if you pity them? That makes no sense to me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/782280492282647377'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/782280492282647377'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1373948031257#c782280492282647377' title=''/><author><name>Anon</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1750878763"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 15, 2013 at 10:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3573613197135067756</id><published>2009-08-22T09:46:52.286-06:00</published><updated>2009-08-22T09:46:52.286-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I got $200.00 on Will.  Any takers?&#xa;&#xa;Let&amp;#39;s mak...</title><content type='html'>I got $200.00 on Will.  Any takers?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Let&amp;#39;s make some cash while kicking some arse.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You know the Lord does have a sense on humor - and justice.  Maybe we can combine both. ;-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/3573613197135067756'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/3573613197135067756'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1250956012286#c3573613197135067756' title=''/><author><name>4EyesOnLiberty</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2038181183"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 22, 2009 at 9:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2677871703189072374</id><published>2009-03-31T06:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2009-03-31T06:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>In the interest of accuracy, let the record reflec...</title><content type='html'>In the interest of accuracy, let the record reflect that I endorsed the impeachment of Comrade Obama just shortly after his election: &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.lewrockwell.com/grigg/grigg-w57.html&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It would be quite an accomplishment for Obama to do more damage than Bush managed to. Just as I anticipated, Obama picked up seamlessly where Bush left off, and then accelerated the process of destruction his Republican predecessor had begun. May God help us, even though I don&#39;t know why He would.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In terms of its ontogeny, it is the Republican Party, rather than the Democratic Party, that is more properly considered Marxist. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Its founding ranks were filled with blood-red &#39;48ers -- veterans of the &lt;BR/&gt;Marxist-influenced European revolutions of 1848. Lincoln&#39;s presidential campaign and his military staff were lousy with those proto-Communist bastards as well.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;What may be the worst of the many bad things about Comrade Obama the Holy (Peace Be Upon Him) is the fact that he has consciously decided to model himself after the Republican Party&#39;s first president; see --&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.lewrockwell.com/grigg/grigg-w62.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/2677871703189072374'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/2677871703189072374'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1238502480000#c2677871703189072374' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 31, 2009 at 6:28 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-85991028422590497</id><published>2009-03-31T03:08:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2009-03-31T03:08:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Are you so un-educated and mis-informed that you c...</title><content type='html'>Are you so un-educated and mis-informed that you call Republicans, who believe and fight for freedom and Constitutionalism, insults with Marxist terms? Wow. May Obama&#39;s Gestapo pay you a visit after you voted for him. And he&#39;s an illegal alien that&#39;s going to sink the Democrat Party. http://www.restoretheconstitutionalrepublic.com/ and http://www.obamacrimes.com/ you jerk-off!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/85991028422590497'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/85991028422590497'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1238490480000#c85991028422590497' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 31, 2009 at 3:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116053920952341001</id><published>2006-10-10T22:00:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-10T22:00:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&#39;s easy to feel angry at tyranny pimps, or parti...</title><content type='html'>It&#39;s easy to feel angry at tyranny pimps, or partisan brownshirts; maybe doubly easy for double-billers like Hannity. Just remember though:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;What is begun in anger ends in shame.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Notwithstanding, though... I&#39;ll hold your coat. ;-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116053920952341001'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116053920952341001'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1160539200000#c116053920952341001' title=''/><author><name>Jamie</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02038802476365589122</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-406328628"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 10, 2006 at 10:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116009835291784738</id><published>2006-10-05T19:32:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-05T19:32:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Damn, and I thought I was good. I&#39;ve been reading ...</title><content type='html'>Damn, and I thought I was good. I&#39;ve been reading you all night, dude, and, despite your unfortunate weakness for all matters religious (nobody&#39;s perfect), I had to blogroll you.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I&#39;d like to see you in action against a talking turd like Levin or Hannity. Hell, I&#39;d order it on Pay Per View.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116009835291784738'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116009835291784738'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1160098320000#c116009835291784738' title=''/><author><name>jurassicpork</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01673461210301442978</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-578765904"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 5, 2006 at 7:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116008350278815945</id><published>2006-10-05T15:25:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-05T15:25:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>William,As much as I would enjoy watching you open...</title><content type='html'>William,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As much as I would enjoy watching you open up a can of whup*** on Sean Hannity, the stupidest and most ignorant of the neocon talk radio show hosts what I would like to see even more is a p.o&#39;d Army or Marine veteran that has done a couple tours of duty in Iraq come back and go up to Hannity at one of his &quot;Freedom concerts&quot; (sic) and bust him in the mouth as hard as he can, telling him &quot;you don&#39;t support the troops, save putting them in harm&#39;s way for everyone else&#39;s benefit except America&#39;s.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is little  difference between Hannity and the &quot;liberals&quot; he always whines about. Like them, he wants to stand in front of the mirror in the morning and say to himself &quot;I&#39;m a good person. I care.&quot; Unfortantely, his sort of do-goodism results in more people getting killed or wounded than the average &quot;liberal&quot; is capable of.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I enjoy your blog. TNA made a mistake by discontinuing it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116008350278815945'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/116008350278815945'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1160083500000#c116008350278815945' title=''/><author><name>Flavius Aetius</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12523103626633461512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-322203959"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 5, 2006 at 3:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115998785165879032</id><published>2006-10-04T12:50:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-04T12:50:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow--great blog!  I was referred here by Daniel Mc...</title><content type='html'>Wow--great blog!  I was referred here by Daniel McCarthy&#39;s site.  I&#39;ve read your work through the years in The New American but I didn&#39;t realize you have your own site with such PUNCHY writing.  I appreciate your perspective.  -Jeff</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115998785165879032'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115998785165879032'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159987800000#c115998785165879032' title=''/><author><name>JT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12511087200420823532</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1192680342"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 4, 2006 at 12:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115990080898356979</id><published>2006-10-03T12:40:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-03T12:40:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I came across your blog today via LewRockwell.com,...</title><content type='html'>I came across your blog today via LewRockwell.com, pointing out a few great posts of yours about the GO(T)P.  I really enjoy your blog and your writing style, and am glad to come across a fellow liberty-minded follower of Jesus.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Keep up the good work!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115990080898356979'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115990080898356979'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159900800000#c115990080898356979' title=''/><author><name>gRegor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12916543738661013048</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1263239102"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 3, 2006 at 12:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115968100433835688</id><published>2006-09-30T23:36:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-09-30T23:36:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>hey djs!i can&#39;t talk.  i had to go look it up myse...</title><content type='html'>hey djs!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;i can&#39;t talk.  i had to go look it up myself!  along the way i saw &quot;mikado&quot; and &quot;miasma&quot;.  what a deal!  i look up one word and get 3 out of it! &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;let me try it out by &quot;sounding my barbaric yalp!&quot;  (maybe will will even like this one).  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;...&quot;the miasmic political stench that spews from sean hannity&#39;s mouth is enough to make a billy goat puke.&quot;  (i felt like using another word i learned in the SF community but it was.....baaaaaaaaaaaaaaaad).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;....&quot;i need a hug&quot;...&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;--from shrek</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115968100433835688'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115968100433835688'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159680960000#c115968100433835688' title=''/>