nd-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1613896268"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 30, 2006 at 9:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115954402079925325</id><published>2006-09-29T09:33:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-09-29T09:33:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks Will,I agree and it is a fun read, you keep...</title><content type='html'>Thanks Will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I agree and it is a fun read, you keep me smiling in these trying times.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;DJS</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115954402079925325'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115954402079925325'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159543980000#c115954402079925325' title=''/><author><name>DJS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03616609130163676140</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1644214747"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 29, 2006 at 9:33 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115953656113640090</id><published>2006-09-29T07:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-09-29T07:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Gosh Will, I wish you&#39;d summon at least a wee bit ...</title><content type='html'>Gosh Will, I wish you&#39;d summon at least a wee bit of verve and invective when you write about the knaves in your world!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Excellent piece,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Charles</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115953656113640090'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115953656113640090'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159536540000#c115953656113640090' title=''/><author><name>Dr Roberts</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05990784212950565473</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1953931538"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 29, 2006 at 7:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115947458166393126</id><published>2006-09-28T14:16:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-09-28T14:16:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&#39;m thinkin&#39; good ol&#39; brotha Grigg must have a min...</title><content type='html'>I&#39;m thinkin&#39; good ol&#39; brotha Grigg must have a mind like mine in so many ways. Indeed, if there&#39;s one type of humanoid I can barely stand, it&#39;s a bell-clappin&#39; alligator mouth with a jaybird ass full of conceit and utter contempt for others who don&#39;t bow and scrape to their mantras. And there&#39;s more than enough of these chest-poundin&#39; psychoids out there on the airwaves.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The &lt;I&gt;only&lt;/I&gt; thing that keeps me in check and under self-control is my reverence for our Lord and admonition to treat others, even those who would despitefully use you, as you wish to be treated. Otherwise, I&#39;d be a continual rage against these dudettes. Seriously...&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There&#39;s one fallacy that many youngsters apparently behave by these days. That is, they think one has to act like a &quot;bad boy&quot; or act the part of a barbarian with a foul mouth to intimidate others and keep them at bay. So much nonsense! I can bash a head while I&#39;m talking to it, no need for antics or drama.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Nevertheless, like you, I&#39;ve no desire to fist fight or beat down another unless absolutely cornered because, for one thing, I have this tendency to go savage and end it quicktime. Once the throwdown begins, there&#39;s no such thing as a &quot;fair&quot; fight. Again, it&#39;s not a drama for public consumption. And, of course, it could always be me that gets the beatdown quicktime as well. So, I do all I can to avoid such situations if at all possible.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;So speaking of bullies of every stripe, we&#39;re in complete and total agreement.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115947458166393126'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115946386467481723/comments/default/115947458166393126'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html?showComment=1159474560000#c115947458166393126' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/09/i-cant-stand-bullies.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115946386467481723' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115946386467481723' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 28, 2006 at 2:16 PM"/></entry></feed>